<chapter xml:id="modules" xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
  <title>Module Catalog</title>
  <para>All modules use the Maven group <code>org.apache.opennlp.addons</code>.</para>
  <para>The repository currently ships no add-on modules. The former add-ons were removed because
        Apache OpenNLP itself, or a maintained replacement, now covers their functionality.</para>
